  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f86f1edd-bc3d-5644-8e93-fbaa6be8b457" activityNameId="98cd065d-d4c8-56b2-8fa4-007ed4f12379" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Capacitor, Tantalum-, through-hole mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Capacitor, Tantalum-, through-hole mounting, at plant
The data represent a tantalum-capacitor for the hole-through mounting technology, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such capacitors. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of capacitors with a weight of 0.254 gram/unit. In 2023, only production efforts data are updated, which are explained in separate modules. Furthermore, material and energy input are now represented by global inventory flows; UUID: a5367a2d-a9cb-3ea2-8a00-0b2fede0ebcb
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used tantalum-containing capacitors for hole-through mounting.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of small electrolyt-capacitors.
Technology: average production of: formulation; build-up process; cutting; bisquing; Pre-Firing; Firing; Tumbling; Termination (SMT) resp. metallization; slitting; winding; metal spray; heat treatment; sawing; lead welding; epoxy filling (THT)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a5367a2d-a9cb-3ea2-8a00-0b2fede0ebcb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
